{
  "id": "E296",
  "title": "Finally Holidays",
  "level": "intermediate",
  "date": "2019-01-30",
  "synopsis": "Ben has come up with a perfect holiday plan.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/959/2c91ea8a2e5ab4766b2f0a0e296e0d5cb84fc29e.mp3?1548159477",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "终于放假了！\n\n本：终于放假了！我要好好休息一个星期。\n丽丽：你想去旅游吗？\n本：我才不去呢，旅游景点人太多了！\n丽丽：那你打算做什么？\n本：我都想好了。每天起了床就打扫房间，然后去饭店吃烤肉，吃完烤肉就去看电影，然后去按摩，按摩完了就回家躺在床上休息。吃吃零食，玩玩手机，然后到了睡觉的时间就可以睡觉了！\n丽丽：听起来很不错，但是你最好也运动运动，别变胖了！",
    "traditional": "終於放假了！\n\n本：終於放假了！我要好好休息一個星期。\n麗麗：你想去旅遊嗎？\n本：我才不去呢，旅遊景點人太多了！\n麗麗：那你打算做什麼？\n本：我都想好了。每天起了床就打掃房間，然後去飯店吃烤肉，吃完烤肉就去看電影，然後去按摩，按摩完了就回家躺在床上休息。吃吃零食，玩玩手機，然後到了睡覺的時間就可以睡覺了！\n麗麗：聽起來很不錯，但是你最好也運動運動，別變胖了！"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Finally, It’s Holidays!"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "本：终于放假了！我要好好休息一个星期。",
      "traditional": "本：終於放假了！我要好好休息一個星期。",
      "pinyin": "běn zhōng yú fàng jià le wǒ yào hǎo hǎo xiū xi yí ge xīng qī",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: Finally, it’s holidays! I’m going to have a good rest for a week."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "丽丽：你想去旅游吗？",
      "traditional": "麗麗：你想去旅遊嗎？",
      "pinyin": "lì lì nǐ xiǎng qù lǚ yóu ma",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lili: Do you want to go traveling?"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "本：我才不去呢，旅游景点人太多了！",
      "traditional": "本：我才不去呢，旅遊景點人太多了！",
      "pinyin": "běn wǒ cái bú qù ne lǚ yóu jǐng diǎn rén tài duō le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: I’m certainly not going. There are too many people at the tourist spots."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "丽丽：那你打算做什么？",
      "traditional": "麗麗：那你打算做什麼？",
      "pinyin": "lì lì nà nǐ dǎ suàn zuò shén me",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lili: Then what do you plan to do?"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "本：我都想好了。",
      "traditional": "本：我都想好了。",
      "pinyin": "běn wǒ dōu xiǎng hǎo le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "每天起了床就打扫房间，然后去饭店吃烤肉，",
      "traditional": "每天起了床就打掃房間，然後去飯店吃烤肉，",
      "pinyin": "měi tiān qǐ le chuáng jiù dǎ sǎo fáng jiān rán hòu qù fàn diàn chī kǎo ròu",
      "english": "Ben: I already have a plan."
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "吃完烤肉就去看电影，然后去按摩，",
      "traditional": "吃完烤肉就去看電影，然後去按摩，",
      "pinyin": "chī wán kǎo ròu jiù qù kàn diàn yǐng rán hòu qù àn mó",
      "english": "Every day after I get up I will clean my room, and then go to a restaurant to eat barbecue."
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "按摩完了就回家躺在床上休息。",
      "traditional": "按摩完了就回家躺在床上休息。",
      "pinyin": "àn mó wán le jiù huí jiā tǎng zài chuáng shang xiū xi",
      "english": "After eating barbecue, I will go watch a movie and then go for a massage."
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "simplified": "吃吃零食，玩玩手机，然后到了睡觉的时间就可以睡觉了！",
      "traditional": "吃吃零食，玩玩手機，然後到了睡覺的時間就可以睡覺了！",
      "pinyin": "chī chī líng shí wán wán shǒu jī rán hòu dào le shuì jiào de shí jiān jiù kě yǐ shuì jiào le",
      "english": "After the massage, I will head back home and lie on my bed to rest."
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "I’ll have some snacks, play with my phone, and when it’s time to sleep, I can go right to sleep!"
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "simplified": "丽丽：听起来很不错，但是你最好也运动运动，别变胖了！",
      "traditional": "麗麗：聽起來很不錯，但是你最好也運動運動，別變胖了！",
      "pinyin": "lì lì tīng qi lai hěn bú cuò dàn shì nǐ zuì hǎo yě yùn dòng yùn dòng bié biàn pàng le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lili: That sounds pretty good, but you’d better exercise a bit as well. Don’t get fat!"
    }
  ],
